{"title":"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A rectangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is made up of five small congruent rectangles as shown in the given figure. Find the perimeter, in cm, of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> if its area is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/2/762e469801e23cbd483120ccda08dbda6f16033b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6750\\text{ cm}^2$\" width=\"69\" height=\"15\" />. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/2/cc22833656d1d99c75ba2eec1c839acb97a7d95c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] import cse5; import olympiad; size(4cm); pathpen=black; pair A=(0,0),B=(0,-2.5),C=(3,-2.5),D=(3,0); D(MP(&quot;A&quot;,A,W)--MP(&quot;B&quot;,B,W)--MP(&quot;C&quot;,C,E)--MP(&quot;D&quot;,D,E)--cycle); D((0,-1.5)--(3,-1.5)); D((1,0)--foot((1,0),(0,-1.5),(3,-1.5))); D((2,0)--foot((2,0),(0,-1.5),(3,-1.5))); D((1.5,-1.5)--(1.5,-2.5));[/asy]\" width=\"192\" height=\"138\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/2/9b25f8e64b484493fda944d25cad453423041fe6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l$\" width=\"5\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/e/9ee4b825a2e36ae093ed7be5e4851ef453b34914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> be the length, and width, respectively, of one of the small rectangles.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/4/21428bb3d8a41aeeeb5858a107e753dec863738d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3w=2l$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/b/07bfe718cc102a901d6304630c4460b0f93c3535.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l=\\dfrac{3}{2}w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"56\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/8/738a91c0ceb8d30d3eef9cfcacc5db962c95eb07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6750= 5lw = \\dfrac{15}{2}w^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"155\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/6/5a6a9f5e5b98c207b5213e7aa0cd31766351bbbc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w=30$\" width=\"55\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/5/765ffb2f53e2332be5d4a8cb04eeabc54e71b506.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l=45$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"47\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>The perimeter of the big rectangle is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/e/50eec5d8bab9f4c32bb0c0edf22d276a274d40e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(w+l)+6w=330$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"160\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can label the short side of the smaller rectangles <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and the long side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />. Additionally, since all the rectangles are congruent we can say that the area of one of the rectangles is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/2/7c221008084f0db5035c82e1873589e2ab90aa25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6750}{5}=1350$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"103\" height=\"38\" />. Using our labels we can get the equations for our systems, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/8/e1859dc87d430b32f29a9eb789d57138ea93d134.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab=1350 \\text{and} (a+b)(2b)=6750$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"252\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/e/84ed9891c28612faaf27ac079c53f468f1ea592d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2ab+2b^2=6750 \\text{ and } 2ab=2700$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"260\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Using elimination,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/9/789cea7f585971f5295657660bf93316adfd97fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2b^2=4050$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"87\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/9/4296a39f93e6e73681ce1c3c05ef82ef4f896eca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2=2025 \\implies b=45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"177\" height=\"17\" /> which also means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/9/03962071fc4c9b65e59ed9e27f612398dbdfcd1f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"54\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>We want to find the area of the big rectangle which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/3/353249bd2576dff1a3eab11840ed8aefe049fe6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(a+b+2b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"104\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in our values we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/0/ba0d9be677f2aee61fef202441142517be0c9b21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(75+90)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"84\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/f/08f19e40c84e593886f0d2b9c6ae9cdd8c90d520.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(165)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"52\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/2/2e2eb1091996d95770019efaf96d4c68e7a00d5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{Perimeter}=\\boxed{330}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"136\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://aops.com/wiki/index.php/User:Am24\">~AM24</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC\" title=\"1997 PMWC\">1997 PMWC </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I10\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I10\">Problem I10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I12\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I12\">Problem I12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\">I: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I1\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I2\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I3\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I4\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I5\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I6\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I7\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I8\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I9\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I10\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I12\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I13\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I14\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_I15\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem I15\">15</a> <br /> T: <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T1\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem T1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T2\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem T2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T3\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem T3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T4\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem T4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T5\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem T5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T6\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem T6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T7\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem T7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T8\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem T8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T9\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem T9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_PMWC_Problems/Problem_T10\" title=\"1997 PMWC Problems/Problem T10\">10</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017190730\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 179/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1658/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 128/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4570/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.936      1 Template:PMWC_box\n100.00%    6.936      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:5486:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017190730 and revision id 259809. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}